@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/bss-core/api

### GET without a cookie -> HTTP 401 SES001
GET {{baseUrl}}/subscriber/me

### GET with an invalid cookie -> HTTP 401 SES001
GET {{baseUrl}}/subscriber/me
Cookie: JSESSIONID=not-a-valid-session

### Mona: successful subscriber login
# Expected DATA: {"MSISDN":"01012345678","FULL_NAME":"Mona Adel","ROLE_CODE":"SUB"}
# Expected cookie: Set-Cookie: JSESSIONID=...; path=/bss-core; HttpOnly
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

msisdn=01012345678&pin=1234

### Mona profile and current balance
# Expected: {"RESULT":"OK","DATA":{"MSISDN":"01012345678","FULL_NAME":"Mona Adel","STATUS":"A","TARIFF_CODE":"PRE01","TARIFF_NAME":"Nile Prepaid","BALANCE_PIASTERS":6750,"ACTIVATION_DT":"01/03/2025"}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/subscriber/me

### SUB is denied operator subscriber lookup -> HTTP 200 SEC001
GET {{baseUrl}}/subscribers/01012345678

### Re-login rotates the existing JSESSIONID
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

msisdn=01012345678&pin=1234

### Missing PIN -> VAL001
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

msisdn=01012345678

### Invalid MSISDN -> VAL001
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

msisdn=123&pin=1234

### Invalid PIN format -> VAL001
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

msisdn=01012345678&pin=12a4

### Unknown MSISDN -> AUTH001
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

msisdn=01099999999&pin=1234

### Wrong PIN -> AUTH001 (same response as unknown MSISDN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

msisdn=01012345678&pin=0000

### Suspended Salma with correct PIN -> AUTH002
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

msisdn=01234567890&pin=1111

### Suspended Salma with wrong PIN -> AUTH001
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

msisdn=01234567890&pin=0000

### Karim: successful subscriber login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

msisdn=01123456789&pin=4321

### Youssef: successful subscriber login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

msisdn=01512345678&pin=2222

### Youssef profile: OLD99 tariff, zero balance, 12/08/2016 activation
# Expected: {"RESULT":"OK","DATA":{"MSISDN":"01512345678","FULL_NAME":"Youssef Fathy","STATUS":"A","TARIFF_CODE":"OLD99","TARIFF_NAME":"Classic 2015","BALANCE_PIASTERS":0,"ACTIVATION_DT":"12/08/2016"}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/subscriber/me

### L-05 acceptance: log Mona in from a clean seed (balance 6750)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

msisdn=01012345678&pin=1234

### L-05 acceptance: debit Mona 3500 piasters
# Expected: {"RESULT":"OK","DATA":{"TXN_ID":50231,"BALANCE_PIASTERS":3250}}
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriber/me/debit
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

amountPiasters=3500&refNo=SC-20261012-000015&reason=BUNDLE+Weekly+Mix

### L-05 acceptance: verify Mona's new balance
# Expected DATA contains "BALANCE_PIASTERS":3250
GET {{baseUrl}}/subscriber/me

# Verify the persisted ledger entry in PostgreSQL:
# SELECT txn_id, msisdn, txn_type, amount_piasters, balance_after, ref_no, reason
# FROM ledger WHERE txn_id = 50231;
# Expected one row: D, 3500, 3250, SC-20261012-000015, "BUNDLE Weekly Mix".

### L-05 acceptance: log Karim in from a clean seed (balance 500)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

msisdn=01123456789&pin=4321

### L-05 acceptance: debit over Karim's balance
# Expected HTTP 200: {"RESULT":"FAIL","ERR_CODE":"BAL002","ERR_MSG":"Insufficient balance"}
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriber/me/debit
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

amountPiasters=750&refNo=SC-20261012-000016&reason=BUNDLE+Weekly+Mix

### L-05 acceptance: failed debit leaves Karim's balance unchanged
# Expected DATA contains "BALANCE_PIASTERS":500
GET {{baseUrl}}/subscriber/me

# Verify the failed request created no ledger row:
# SELECT count(*) FROM ledger WHERE ref_no = 'SC-20261012-000016';
# Expected: 0.

### L-05 acceptance: missing reason -> VAL001
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriber/me/debit
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

amountPiasters=100&refNo=SC-20261012-000017

### L-05 acceptance: invalid refNo -> VAL001
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriber/me/debit
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

amountPiasters=100&refNo=ab&reason=BUNDLE+Weekly+Mix

### L-05 acceptance: empty amountPiasters -> VAL001
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriber/me/debit
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

amountPiasters=&refNo=SC-20261012-000018&reason=BUNDLE+Weekly+Mix

### Youssef profile: OLD99 tariff, zero balance, 12/08/2016 activation
# Expected: {"RESULT":"OK","DATA":{"MSISDN":"01512345678","FULL_NAME":"Youssef Fathy","STATUS":"A","TARIFF_CODE":"OLD99","TARIFF_NAME":"Classic 2015","BALANCE_PIASTERS":0,"ACTIVATION_DT":"12/08/2016"}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/subscriber/me

### L-13 acceptance: log Mona in
# Run the L-05 debit of SC-20261012-000015 above first, from a clean seed (Mona's balance is then 3250).
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

msisdn=01012345678&pin=1234

### L-13 acceptance: refund the debit SC-20261012-000015 in full
# Expected: {"RESULT":"OK","DATA":{"TXN_ID":50232,"AMOUNT_PIASTERS":3500,"BALANCE_PIASTERS":6750}}
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriber/me/refund
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

refNo=SC-20261012-000015

### L-13 acceptance: verify Mona's balance is back to 6750
# Expected DATA contains "BALANCE_PIASTERS":6750
GET {{baseUrl}}/subscriber/me

# Verify the refund row in PostgreSQL:
# SELECT txn_id, txn_type, amount_piasters, balance_after, ref_no, reason FROM ledger WHERE txn_id = 50232;
# Expected one row: F, 3500, 6750, SC-20261012-000015, REFUND.

### L-13 error: the same refund again -> TXN003
# Expected HTTP 200: {"RESULT":"FAIL","ERR_CODE":"TXN003","ERR_MSG":"Transaction already refunded"}
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriber/me/refund
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

refNo=SC-20261012-000015

### L-13 error: the seed debit that was already refunded (ledger rows 50215/50216) -> TXN003
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriber/me/refund
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

refNo=SC-20261009-000007

### L-13 error: reference number that no debit has -> TXN404
# Expected HTTP 200: {"RESULT":"FAIL","ERR_CODE":"TXN404","ERR_MSG":"Transaction not found"}
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriber/me/refund
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

refNo=SC-20269999-000001

### L-13 error: empty refNo -> VAL001
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriber/me/refund
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

refNo=

### L-13 error: refNo field missing -> VAL001
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriber/me/refund
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

other=1

### L-13 error: no valid session -> HTTP 401 SES001
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriber/me/refund
Cookie: JSESSIONID=not-a-valid-session
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

refNo=SC-20261012-000015

### L-13 acceptance: a suspended line can still be refunded (business rule 5)
# 1. Log Mona in and debit: amountPiasters=500&refNo=SC-20261012-000020&reason=BUNDLE+Social+Day
# 2. In PostgreSQL: UPDATE subscriber SET status = 'S' WHERE msisdn = '01012345678';
# 3. Send the refund below. Expected OK with AMOUNT_PIASTERS 500 (a new debit would now answer SUB002).
# 4. Revert: UPDATE subscriber SET status = 'A' WHERE msisdn = '01012345678';
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriber/me/refund
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

refNo=SC-20261012-000020

### L-13 error: Karim logs in and tries to refund Mona's debit -> TXN404
# A debit of another subscriber counts as "no debit with this reference number".
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

msisdn=01123456789&pin=4321

### L-13 error: Karim refunds Mona's reference -> TXN404
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriber/me/refund
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

refNo=SC-20261012-000015
